  (text "Passive copper only. Pin 1=+24V, 2=W, 3=N, 4=C in the OUTSIDE installed view.\nSeparate net names denote isolation ON THIS FLEX, joined by LED-strip through rails only after assembly.\nUpper unused end pads have explicit no-connects: they are isolated probe/solder lands, not missing routes.\nNo zone boundary bridges; no commoning of the six fused +24V supplies. See wiring matrix and assembly instructions."
